                  "author": {
                    "__typename": "User",
                    "login": "xingyaoww"
                  },
                  "body": "I think we need to move the .backward() with in the context (https://github.com/volcengine/verl/pull/436/files#diff-07c65794985259af3f0f8e156fcf70119ad136cd42e06b4c6584799b1ebc8f2fR300)\r\n\r\notherwise SP will likely cause OOM issue",
                  "createdAt": "2025-03-04T20:50:56Z",
                  "databaseId": 1980210022,
                  "diffHunk": "@@ -394,8 +394,10 @@ def training_step(self, batch: TensorDict):\n         n_micro_batches = len(micro_batches)\n         step_loss = 0\n         for micro_batch in micro_batches:\n-            loss = self._compute_loss_and_backward(batch=micro_batch) / n_micro_batches\n+            loss = self._compute_loss_and_backward(batch=micro_batch, do_backward=False) / n_micro_batches\n+            loss.backward()",
                  "line": 398,
                  "originalLine": 398,
                  "path": "verl/trainer/fsdp_sft_trainer.py",
                  "updatedAt": "2025-03-04T20:50:57Z",
                  "url": "https://github.com/verl-project/verl/pull/436#discussion_r1980210022"
                }
              ],
              "pageInfo": {
                "endCursor": "Y3Vyc29yOnYyOpK0MjAyNS0wMy0wNFQyMDo1MDo1NlrOdgebZg==",
                "hasNextPage": false
              },
              "totalCount": 1
            },
            "databaseId": 2658960032,
            "state": "COMMENTED",
            "submittedAt": "2025-03-04T20:50:57Z",
            "url": "https://github.com/verl-project/verl/pull/436#pullrequestreview-2658960032"
